      "summary": "To update your billing information, please follow these steps:\n\n1. Go to Account Settings.\n2. Navigate to the Billing section.\n3. Under Payment Methods, click Edit on your current payment method to update your card details. Alternatively, you can add a new payment method.\n\nIf you encounter any issues during this process, feel free to reach out for further assistance.",
