      "artifacts": {},
      "summary": "I completely understand the importance of keeping your billing information up-to-date, and I'm here to help guide you through the process. To update your billing information, simply go to Account Settings, then select Billing, followed by Payment Methods. From there, click Edit on your current payment method to update your card details, or you can choose to add a new payment method. If you have any trouble along the way, please don't hesitate to reach out. We're here to ensure everything goes smoothly for you.",
